build a WalT image using a Dockerfile

Usage:
    walt image build --from-url <git-repo-url> [OPTIONS] <image-name>
    walt image build --from-dir <local-directory> [OPTIONS] <image-name>

    OPTIONS:
    --sub-dir <path>
    --with-node <node>
    --file <dockerfile>

    See 'walt help show image-build' for more info.
    
Meta-switches:
    -h, --help                    Prints this help message and quits

Switches:
    --file DOCKERFILE:str         The Dockerfile or ContainerFile to use
    --from-dir DIRECTORY:str      Local directory to use for the build
    --from-url GIT_URL:str        Git repository URL containing a Dockerfile
    --sub-dir PATH:str            Sub-directory of the git repo to use for the build
    --with-node NODE:str          The node to use for 'RUN --on-node <cmd>' steps

